{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"79c17fe6662b12d6e78f7e16335a0914c1e1c40853e402d681ff033a26c81ac8","ja":"カワイイ食レポ♪","zh":"可爱的美食报道♪","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"79942c9bf6e7c4868465277027dadc394aac506d00025a53076afc8cb4aaef64","ja":"響、茜、風花、紬の今日のお仕事は商店街での食レポ。\nまずは響と風花がクレープ屋さんで……","zh":"响、茜、风花、紬今天的工作是在商业街做美食探店。\n首先是响和风花来到可丽饼店……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5ffb0616721c58448f76493f07e2404509e7a0cbe4ed126e3bf111d013bc15a2","ja":"これ、すっごくあまいぞ♪　生クリームもチョコも、\n全身に染み渡って、元気になる味さー！","zh":"这个超级甜哦♪　鲜奶油和巧克力都\n浸透了全身，是能让人打起精神来的味道呢——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1b899df24eea0c3cab8d53bc9dabe194bf842612f88eccfa341a6082add71b5f","ja":"そんなに？　さすが人気のお店ね。","zh":"这么多吗？真不愧是人气店铺呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"27ad95eb7561da0520e86d61e3dad89fcd167c5b83dd52dbfefb6ae1fe72fd8b","ja":"あ、風花はサラダのにしたんだね。\nじゃあ、はいこれ。チョコバナナ一口あげる♪","zh":"啊，风花选了沙拉可丽饼啊。\n那，给你这个。分你吃一口巧克力香蕉的♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"976ba96557d952cb31b54c92e49d0fe62040794d5832a87f703fbd37559bffd0","ja":"え？　いいの？","zh":"咦？可以吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"647cfdfe1813346104b9dd1417f70840502c7b8f7dfc2230399dde2247eb0dd9","ja":"えへへ……風花のもあとで一口ほしいぞ。\nだから交換ってことで……。","zh":"嘿嘿……风花的等会儿我也想尝一口呢。\n所以就算是交换啦……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f62fe4cf580b7a6f8999b4f4af595b0480d12600de32447fdd64ce0b9db35528","ja":"はい、風花。あ～んして、あ～ん。","zh":"来，风花。张嘴，啊～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"78194002c54212c45cb6fc4c140c98f3f4087ba2c6efd2fdc12398f30078a98b","ja":"え？　照れちゃうわね……。\nだけど、せっかくだから……あ～ん。","zh":"哎？怪让人难为情的……\n不过难得有这个机会……啊～嗯。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2117c7f523c7699dddd9419c644f4efa72381adc854613b62dd1a3064281909c","ja":"おふたりとも、さすがですね。\nとても可愛らしい食レポです。","zh":"两位都表现得十分出色呢。\n非常可爱又生动的美食播报。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"29a8d380ab42ded4525e3f6553ede53e3e115db280b1ed9cec3649ebba2544a9","ja":"チッチッチ！　驚くのはまだ早いよ、つむりん。\n茜ちゃんは、もっとカワイイ食レポしちゃうんだから！","zh":"啧啧啧！现在惊讶还太早了哦，紬紬。\n小茜可是能做出更可爱的美食repo的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"886b7eb1a15e3fea086f7b12db95c491e25c6fc5a0442c083f289066e5f77e44","ja":"そうなのですね、楽しみです。\nあ、ですが……私たちはラーメンですよね？","zh":"是这样啊，真让人期待。\n啊，不过……我们吃的是拉面吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a33bead27a7e37b4d41f150a202de68fcd0e84a02b20b4827883cd4a1aaaac82","ja":"可愛く食レポするのは\n難しいように思うのですが……。","zh":"要把美食报告做得可爱，\n感觉挺难的呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c4f9a3d63c25b4c9da9db5d5cdd8254ef743489e6a6457ab239a6602f1754470","ja":"問題ないよ！　茜ちゃんにかかれば、\nどんな食べ物だって、カワイイを表現できちゃうから♪","zh":"没问题！只要交给小茜，\n不管什么食物，都能表现出可爱的一面哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1086.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"7ce0eb00ad8b3af03c6a603334e420445a99dbe23a6093de2e9ed117b0a8026e","ja":"撮れ高バッチリなとびっきりの作戦があるから、\nしっかり見ててね♪","zh":"我有能拍出绝佳镜头的绝妙作战，\n要好好看着哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
